'''Mecha''' (ロボトモ, ''Robotomo'', '''Robot Friends''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (Sm): Slow duration increases by 10%.

